---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Engineering Tools — HowNote">
  <section class="hero container">
    <div class="eyebrow">HowNote Tools</div>
    <h1>Engineering calculators and size converters built for repeat use.</h1>
    <p>Start with pipe size cross-reference and weight calculation, then move into standards and sourcing checks.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="container grid">
    <article class="card"><h2>DN ↔ NPS ↔ A Converter</h2><p class="muted">Cross-reference nominal pipe-size designations and keep them separate from actual outside diameter.</p><a href="/tools/dn-nps-a-converter">Open converter →</a></article>
    <article class="card"><h2>Pipe Weight Calculator</h2><p class="muted">Calculate theoretical pipe mass from standard reference sizes or custom OD and wall thickness.</p><a href="/tools/pipe-weight-calculator">Open calculator →</a></article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
